是暂停、停了没有、是不是只给过一次（医院；养老院变体）」 <span class=\"notranslate\" translate=\"no\" lang=\"en\">Typed medication questions with one right answer: why held, held now, stopped, given once (Hospital; NH variants)</span></p><p><b>覆盖的 UAT 步骤 / 票 AC：</b></p><ul><li><b>U2</b> A typed custom question is answered correctly.（UAT TC-15；TFA-92593 AC 5）</li><li><b>U5</b> The current-medications answer reflects the Medication Tracker; held drugs show as held.（UAT TC-15；TFA-92593 AC 7）</li><li><b>U4</b> Answers are grounded only in that patient's data: no cross-patient bleed, no invented information, no outside data; per 3.4 no guessed units on ambiguous values and no narration of documentation stat …（UAT TC-15；TFA-92593 AC 3；UAT 3.4）</li></ul><p><b>测试设计方法：</b>等价类（equivalence） — 同一条规则换一类输入（医院 / 养老院、另一种数据）再验一次，每一类都要对。</p><p><b>Given </b>Tracker with one row per status class: active, held (soft BP), discontinued, one-time dose</p><p><b>When </b>Type &quot;Why is the lisinopril held?&quot;; variants type the status questions, in both modes</p><p><b>Then </b>The stored reason is given; held reads as held, stopped as stopped, the one-time dose as given once</p><p><b>通过的标准（oracle，节选）：</b>Main: mustInclude BP / blood pressure / hypotension, no other reason (U2, U4). Variants: lisinopril → 'held|on hold'; enoxaparin → 'stopped|discontinued|no longer'; ondansetron → 'once|one-time|single'. A stopped drug presented as current is a Fail whatever Q3 decides</p><p><b>在哪跑：</b>dev 单元 U36；测试方法 AICHECK · AI 输出检查；矩阵里排的车道 AI 检查（automated）</p><p><small>S07 是我们自己编的用例号（覆盖矩阵 cases/TC-15.matrix.json 里的编号），不是 UAT 文档里的步骤号。</small></p></div><p><b>环境：dev</b> — dev 部署，build <code>e02167f</code>（Deploy Convex，2026-10-12T18:24:27Z）；账号和地址不写进报告；run folder <code>runs/2026-10-14-dev</code>。</p><p><b>测试方法：</b>AICHECK · AI 输出检查；辅助：AGENT · 浏览器 agent — 按 cases/test-methods.json 的分类，分类说在 both 跑；来源：<code>dev</code>。</p><p><b>UAT item:</b> TC-15 Ask AI · <b>Section:</b> A3 · Encounter · <b>Scenario:</b> TC-15/S07</p><p><b>Typed medication questions with one right answer: why held, held now, stopped, given once (Hospital; NH variants)</b></p><p><b>Tickets:</b> TFA-92593 Ask AI (ready for qa)</p><p><b>Result:</b> Pass from <code>scripts/oracle.mjs</code> on the saved evidence (<code>units/U36.verdict.json</code>), unit U36. Agent: 69 turns, 385 s, $0.43.</p><p><b>Plan:</b> unit U36 (#36, ready-for-qa, live AI (Save Note / Save &amp; Extract / Ask AI)) — Pre-Round Ask: typed medication questions. Its Alvarez rows differ from every other Ask part's same-named patients.</p><p><b>Checked by Quinn's runner</b> (<code>ledger.md</code> #36, U36; checked: yes): <b>Blocked → runner fix</b> — GOAL starts with 'Navigate to &lt;chart URL&gt;' right after START opened /rounding → beforeunload ('leave site?') while the list's on-load writes were pending. Prompt: open the GOAL's first URL directly. Re-run below</p><p><b>Checked by Quinn's runner</b> (<code>ledger.md</code> #36b; checked: yes): <b>Pass</b> — 2nd run: 5/7, budget ran out on dev (maxSteps 56→80); 3rd run 7/7: why held / held now / stopped / given once answered from the tracker, both modes (e.g. 'not currently on lisinopril… held since Sep 29 for soft BP')</p>","environment":"default","setup":[],"teardown":[],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["TC-15 Ask AI","S07 Typed medication questions with one right answer: why held, held now, stopped, given once (Hospital…"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":[],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[{"link":{"id":"32bc12a9a4f8c28ba3f6efe66c7dea57","originalFileName":"a2788065-520a-404d-b8f3-6c82ef5b9955-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","name":"page snapshot (accessibility tree)","contentType":"text/plain","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":5299},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"49f8295175c461ccad18746b13898060","originalFileName":"e204ca67-959c-442c-8603-ccfbb75ce13d-attachment.png","ext":".png","name":"screenshot","contentType":"image/png","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":82983},"type":"attachmen